-- v0.31 gives every deity a way into a story. Deities that had no claims
-- receive short, source-located stories or card-level claims; living
-- traditions keep their access policies, so Ogun and Olodumare stay
-- permission-limited instead of receiving invented narratives. Later
-- literary layers (Journey to the West) stay in LATER_RECEPTION, and modern
-- syntheses (UCL Digital Egypt, Te Ara, NPS) are labelled as such.

